https://fontawesome.com/license/free
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Source: https://github.com/FortAwesome/Font-Awesome (5.x)
React Icons source: https://github.com/react-icons/react-icons (MIT code license).

Color is substituted for currentColor at build time. Brand marks remain the
property of their respective owners; inclusion does not imply endorsement.
The layout engine is adapted from this repository's deep-navy-md-to-pptx skill.
